OL,3,GNEWSA'Communication issues' severely
OL,4,Adisrupt city trams
OL,5,
OL,6,FTram services in Nottingham are
OL,7,Fseverely disrupted after the operator
OL,8,Fexperienced "communication issues".
OL,10,FNottingham Express Transit (NET)
OL,11,Ftemporarily withdrew all services on
OL,12,FThursday afternoon, and said it was
OL,13,F"unable to operate our services as
OL,14,Fusual".
OL,16,FThe firm apologised for "any
OL,17,Finconvenience caused" and its website
OL,18,Fsaid tram customers were able to use
OL,19,Ftheir tickets on Nottingham City
OL,20,FTransport services.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,369,360,200,160,0,100
